1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,093
This assignment builds an end-to-end MLOps pipeline for
predicting the presence of

2
00:00:06,093 --> 00:00:11,387
heart disease from thirteen patient features. I use the
UCI Heart Disease

3
00:00:11,387 --> 00:00:16,680
dataset, compare two classifiers, track experiments with
MLflow, and serve the selected

4
00:00:16,680 --> 00:00:21,973
model through FastAPI. I will show the path from data
and training

5
00:00:21,973 --> 00:00:25,061
to automated checks, Docker, Kubernetes, and monitoring.

6
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:34,578
The downloaded dataset contains three hundred and three
rows, thirteen input features,

7
00:00:34,578 --> 00:00:39,876
and one binary target. There are one hundred and sixty-
five positive cases

8
00:00:39,876 --> 00:00:45,174
and one hundred and thirty-eight negative cases, so the
imbalance is mild.

9
00:00:45,174 --> 00:00:50,472
I checked missing values and duplicates and examined
feature distributions and correlations.

10
00:00:50,472 --> 00:00:55,770
Evaluation uses shuffled, stratified folds to preserve
class proportions and avoid bias

11
00:00:55,770 --> 00:00:57,536
from the dataset's ordering.

12
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:08,057
Preprocessing is part of the model pipeline. Numeric
features receive median imputation

13
00:01:08,057 --> 00:01:13,515
and standard scaling. Categorical features receive most-
frequent imputation and one-hot encoding, with

14
00:01:13,515 --> 00:01:18,972
unseen categories handled safely. Keeping preprocessing
inside the pipeline fits it within

15
00:01:18,972 --> 00:01:24,429
each training fold and reuses it at inference. I tune
Logistic Regression

16
00:01:24,429 --> 00:01:29,886
and Random Forest with five-fold stratified cross-
validation. Random Forest is selected by

17
00:01:29,886 --> 00:01:35,344
the highest mean ROC-AUC: about zero point nine one
eight, compared with

18
00:01:35,344 --> 00:01:40,801
zero point nine one seven for Logistic Regression. That
margin is tiny,

19
00:01:40,801 --> 00:01:46,258
and Logistic Regression has higher recall. Tuning and
evaluation reuse the same

20
00:01:46,258 --> 00:01:49,441
folds, so these estimates may be optimistic.

21
00:01:52,512 --> 00:01:57,886
These are the tracked runs for the two candidate models.
Each run

22
00:01:57,886 --> 00:02:03,260
records model parameters, tuned settings, accuracy,
precision, recall, and ROC-AUC. The artifacts

23
00:02:03,260 --> 00:02:08,635
include grid-search results, an out-of-fold ROC curve, a
confusion matrix, and the

24
00:02:08,635 --> 00:02:14,009
fitted model. This lets me inspect how a result was
produced and

25
00:02:14,009 --> 00:02:17,144
compare experiments using the same evaluation setup.

26
00:02:23,312 --> 00:02:28,998
The packaged joblib file contains both preprocessing and
the selected classifier. Training

27
00:02:28,998 --> 00:02:34,684
and serving dependencies are pinned, with a smaller
requirements file for the

28
00:02:34,684 --> 00:02:40,370
serving image. The seven tests cover the dataset
contract, preprocessing, missing-value handling,

29
00:02:40,370 --> 00:02:46,056
model inference, and API validation. Here are the local
test and lint

30
00:02:46,056 --> 00:02:51,742
results. GitHub Actions repeats linting, data
acquisition, training, tests, and a Docker

31
00:02:51,742 --> 00:02:57,428
build. A failing step fails the workflow, and the
artifact step preserves

32
00:02:57,428 --> 00:02:59,323
available metrics and screenshots.

33
00:03:04,432 --> 00:03:09,356
The Docker image contains the saved pipeline and starts
the FastAPI server.

34
00:03:09,356 --> 00:03:14,281
This health request confirms the API is reachable. I now
submit the

35
00:03:14,281 --> 00:03:19,205
sample patient's thirteen features to the prediction
endpoint. The saved model returns

36
00:03:19,205 --> 00:03:24,130
class one, labelled disease, with a positive-class
probability of zero point six

37
00:03:24,130 --> 00:03:29,054
five two. The probability field always refers to the
disease class. Input

38
00:03:29,054 --> 00:03:33,978
validation rejects invalid or incomplete requests before
they reach the model. This

39
00:03:33,978 --> 00:03:38,492
is an educational model, rather than a tool for clinical
decisions.

40
00:03:43,512 --> 00:03:48,473
The same image is deployed to local Minikube using these
manifests. The

41
00:03:48,473 --> 00:03:53,434
deployment requests two replicas and defines resource
limits, readiness checks, and liveness

42
00:03:53,434 --> 00:03:58,395
checks. Here, both pods are ready, and the rollout has
completed. The

43
00:03:58,395 --> 00:04:03,356
service is configured as a LoadBalancer. On this local
setup, I access

44
00:04:03,356 --> 00:04:08,318
it through port-forwarding; a pending external IP does
not prevent this demonstration.

45
00:04:08,318 --> 00:04:13,279
This request goes through the Kubernetes service and
returns a prediction from

46
00:04:13,279 --> 00:04:14,519
the deployed model.

47
00:04:19,592 --> 00:04:25,307
The monitoring stack runs the API, Prometheus, and
Grafana. Prometheus scrapes the

48
00:04:25,307 --> 00:04:31,022
API every fifteen seconds; this target is up. After
sending prediction requests,

49
00:04:31,022 --> 00:04:36,738
the Grafana dashboard displays prediction counts,
request rates, latency, class distribution, and

50
00:04:36,738 --> 00:04:42,453
process CPU usage. The request logs connect an input
with its prediction

51
00:04:42,453 --> 00:04:48,169
and probability. The disease-rate gauge can flag changes
in predicted class mix,

52
00:04:48,169 --> 00:04:53,884
but it cannot establish model accuracy or confirm drift
without further evidence

53
00:04:53,884 --> 00:04:55,313
and ground-truth labels.

54
00:04:59,592 --> 00:05:06,209
The repository includes the download and training
scripts, reusable pipeline, tests, CI

55
00:05:06,209 --> 00:05:12,826
workflow, deployment manifests, monitoring
configuration, and report. This demonstration connects a
reproducible

56
00:05:12,826 --> 00:05:19,443
experiment to a tested, containerised, locally deployed
API with operational visibility. The

57
00:05:19,443 --> 00:05:26,060
main limitations are the small dataset, shared tuning
and evaluation folds, and

58
00:05:26,060 --> 00:05:29,368
the absence of live ground-truth labels.

